{"work_id": "MX2-018", "matched_key": "和中央社扫荡报新民报三记者的谈话", "normalized_offset": 456, "normalized_context": "相协助三国共两党是否有分裂的可能毛泽东说如果只说到可能性的话那末团结和分裂两种可能性都有我们不但希望长期合作而且努力争取这种合作但是要给长期合作找到政治保证分裂的可能性才能彻底避免这就是坚持抗战到底和实行民主政治这个谈话编入毛泽东选集时题为和中央社扫荡报新民报三记者的谈话9月18日出席在中央大礼堂举行的延安各机关学校团体纪念九一八八周年大会并讲话他说九一八到今天已有八年了卢沟桥抗战也打了两年了可是现在中国还是在两条道路上徘徊着一条是妥协投降分裂倒退的道路这就是亡国的道路一条是坚持抗战反对投降坚持团结反对分裂坚持进步反对倒退的道路这就是复兴的道路我们的口号只有一个就是打到鸭绿江边收复一切", "cue_words": ["编入"], "title_form_signal": "book_title_marks", "witness_id": "A-3aabe7d7d8be471b024f", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/M0rtzz/Selected-Works-of-MaoTseTung/4cc981c232e1ffe8fe2974e125c00af8376829ca/%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E5%B9%B4%E8%B0%B1/2023%E5%B9%B4%E7%89%88/%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E5%B9%B4%E8%B0%B1_%E7%AC%AC2%E5%8D%B7%EF%BC%881937.07-1945.08%EF%BC%89.pdf", "raw_sha256": "2ee8791d0eb2d0babb07135205cd9c9cf32a6a9866e03a06e34e753ad0c9bfed", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "nianpu-2023-9", "volume": 2, "basis": "mirror_folder_and_filename_pending_book_imprint_check"}], "kind": "pdf_page", "number": 145, "end": 145, "record_path": "archive/records/A-3aabe7d7d8be471b024f.json", "text_path": "archive/text/A-3aabe7d7d8be471b024f.txt", "source_title": "毛泽东年谱_第2卷（1937.07-1945.08）", "source_media": "pdf", "source_layer": "digital_PDF_copy", "edition_verification_status": "source_bytes_verified_imprint_images_available_for_review", "public_url_rechecked_this_run": false, "family": "nianpu", "id": "C-0b4d97ba89e4a3b7", "status": "candidate_only_not_work_identity_revision_or_causation", "normalization": "NFKC plus letters/digits only; context is NOT a verbatim quote"}
